  <strong>💡 Tip:</strong> If you're currently on Klaviyo and underusing it, run a feature audit before your next renewal. List every flow and segment you have live. If you're not using predictive analytics, SMS, or benchmark reporting, you have a strong case to migrate to Moosend and reallocate that budget to growth channels.
</div>

